        "text": "=Here is the query ticket email :\n\nsubject : {{ $json.Subject }}\nsnippet : {{ $json.snippet }}\nsender's_email : {{ $json.From }}",
        "options": {
          "systemPromptTemplate": "You are our company's query ticket replier, the customers/clients asks mostly the same questions so based on that I have collected all that repeating stuff in a docs so that you can search them and generate an answer for them. Flag these type of queries as \"usual_query\".\nif confidence is low or no doc matches → don't answer, flag why it was flagged (no match / low similarity / ambiguous intent — pick your reason). Faking the answer or hallucinating it won't be tollerated.\nThe tickets and their reply are sent via email.\n----------------\nContext: {context}\n----------------\n\nOutput Format:\n\"flag\" : \"no_match\" | \"low_similarity\" | \"ambigous_intent\" | \"usual_query\"\n\"description\" : \"reply to the client's ticket if it is a usual_query ,in other cases, describe why it is flagged\"\n"
        }
